# Records the README demo GIF from the real Messages database on this Mac.
#   DEMO_QUERY="dinner" npm run demo
# Real text and names, phone numbers and emails starred out (see
# scripts/demo-transcript.mjs). Review every frame before committing.

Output assets/demo.gif

Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 17
Set Width 1000
Set Height 600
Set Padding 28
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 0

Hide
Type "clear && node scripts/demo-transcript.mjs"
Enter
Show
Sleep 40s
